# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to tighten bounds with a speed limit for the latest version of Shaded lightcones"
msgstr "Cara memperketat bound dengan speed limit untuk versi terbaru Shaded lightcones"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to tighten bounds with a speed limit"
msgstr "Cara memperketat bound dengan speed limit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/speed-limit-tightening.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Information in a circuit of two-qubit gates cannot spread arbitrarily fast. An error occurring\n"
"several layers before the end, on a qubit far from the observable's support, has no path to reach\n"
"it. `tighten_with_speed_limit` turns that geometric argument (the same intuition behind the\n"
"Lieb-Robinson bounds) into tighter forward bounds.\n"
msgstr "Informasi dalam circuit gate dua qubit tidak bisa menyebar secepat-cepatnya tanpa batas. Error yang terjadi beberapa layer sebelum akhir, pada qubit yang jauh dari support observable, tidak punya jalur untuk mencapainya. `tighten_with_speed_limit` mengubah argumen geometris itu (intuisi yang sama dengan batas Lieb-Robinson) menjadi bound maju yang lebih ketat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The step is cheap, needs nothing beyond what the forward bounds already required, and can only make\n"
"bounds tighter. There is no accuracy trade-off to weigh.\n"
msgstr "Langkah ini murah, tidak membutuhkan apa pun di luar yang sudah diperlukan bound maju, dan hanya bisa membuat bound lebih ketat. Tidak ada trade-off akurasi yang perlu dipertimbangkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The question worth answering first is *\"when does it help?\"*, because it doesn't often help on a fully converged set of forward\n"
"bounds.\n"
msgstr "Pertanyaan yang layak dijawab lebih dulu adalah *\"kapan ini membantu?\"*, karena langkah ini tidak sering membantu pada kumpulan bound maju yang sudah konvergen sepenuhnya.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "Penyiapan {#setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the same Trotterized Ising circuit as the [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart), with the observable\n"
"on a single qubit in the middle of the chain. The 1D geometry makes the effect easy to reason about: an influence has\n"
"to traverse the chain one bond per layer.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan circuit Ising Trotterisasi yang sama dengan [panduan quickstart](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart), dengan observable pada satu qubit di tengah rantai. Geometri 1D membuat efeknya mudah dipikirkan: sebuah pengaruh harus menelusuri rantai satu ikatan per layer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When it helps, and when it does not {#when-it-helps-and-when-it-does-not}"
msgstr "Kapan membantu, dan kapan tidak {#when-it-helps-and-when-it-does-not}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`tighten_with_speed_limit` takes the bounds you already have and returns a tightened copy; your\n"
"original bounds are never modified. How much it gains depends entirely on how loose the input was.\n"
msgstr "`tighten_with_speed_limit` mengambil bound yang sudah kamu punya dan mengembalikan salinan yang diperketat; bound aslimu tidak pernah diubah. Seberapa besar keuntungannya sepenuhnya bergantung pada seberapa longgar input-nya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first line is the one to notice. On fully computed forward bounds, the speed limit changes\n"
"nothing. That is not a failure. It means the bounds were already at least as tight as the geometric\n"
"argument can prove, because the operator evolution has effectively discovered the light cone for\n"
"itself.\n"
msgstr "Baris pertama adalah yang perlu diperhatikan. Pada bound maju yang dihitung penuh, speed limit tidak mengubah apa pun. Itu bukan kegagalan. Artinya bound-nya sudah sama ketatnya dengan yang bisa dibuktikan argumen geometris, karena evolusi operator secara efektif sudah menemukan light cone-nya sendiri.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gains appear where the bounds were *not* fully computed:\n"
msgstr "Keuntungannya muncul di tempat bound-nya *tidak* dihitung penuh:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`eigval_max_qubits=0` forces the triangle-inequality fallback, so the bounds no longer reflect the\n"
"commutator's actual spectral norm. The speed limit recovers part of that loss.\n"
msgstr "`eigval_max_qubits=0` memaksa fallback pertidaksamaan segitiga, sehingga bound tidak lagi mencerminkan norma spektral komutator yang sebenarnya. Speed limit memulihkan sebagian dari kehilangan itu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`max_num_boxes=2` leaves most layers at the trivial bound of 2.0 (a bound that encodes no\n"
"information). Here, the speed limit is helpful, cutting the mean by roughly\n"
"a factor of three.\n"
msgstr "`max_num_boxes=2` membiarkan sebagian besar layer pada bound trivial 2.0 (bound yang tidak menyandi informasi apa pun). Di sini, speed limit sangat membantu, memotong rata-ratanya sekitar tiga kali lipat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In every case the \"loosened\" column is zero. No term is ever made worse, which is the guarantee that\n"
"makes the step safe to apply unconditionally.\n"
msgstr "Dalam setiap kasus kolom \"loosened\" bernilai nol. Tidak ada suku yang pernah dibuat lebih buruk, dan itulah jaminan yang membuat langkah ini aman diterapkan tanpa syarat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What it buys in sampling overhead {#what-it-buys-in-sampling-overhead}"
msgstr "Yang didapat dalam overhead sampling {#what-it-buys-in-sampling-overhead}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tighter bounds mean there are fewer error terms that need mitigating for a given bias tolerance, which is the\n"
"number that matters on hardware.\n"
msgstr "Bound yang lebih ketat berarti lebih sedikit suku error yang perlu dimitigasi untuk toleransi bias tertentu, dan angka itulah yang penting di hardware.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When to use it {#when-to-use-it}"
msgstr "Kapan memakainya {#when-to-use-it}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apply it to forward bounds whenever those bounds are not fully converged (essentially,\n"
"whenever you have traded accuracy for speed by using any of the options in the\n"
"[configuration guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/configuration-options)). It is cheap compared to the bounds computation,\n"
"cannot make anything worse, and recovers much of what a `max_num_boxes` or `eigval_max_qubits` limit\n"
"gave away.\n"
msgstr "Terapkan pada bound maju kapan pun bound tersebut belum konvergen sepenuhnya (pada dasarnya, setiap kali kamu menukar akurasi dengan kecepatan memakai opsi apa pun di [panduan konfigurasi](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/configuration-options)). Langkah ini murah dibandingkan komputasi bound, tidak bisa membuat apa pun lebih buruk, dan memulihkan sebagian besar yang dikorbankan oleh batas `max_num_boxes` atau `eigval_max_qubits`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On fully computed bounds it is a no-op, so there is no harm in applying it unconditionally.\n"
msgstr "Pada bound yang dihitung penuh, langkah ini no-op, jadi tidak ada ruginya menerapkannya tanpa syarat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two limitations:\n"
msgstr "Dua keterbatasan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It applies to **forward** bounds only. Backward bounds concern the error's effect on the initial\n"
"state rather than on the observable, so the argument does not carry over.\n"
msgstr "Hanya berlaku untuk bound **maju**. Bound mundur menyangkut pengaruh error terhadap state awal, bukan terhadap observable, jadi argumennya tidak berlaku.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The observable must be a **single Pauli term**. For an observable with several terms, call this\n"
"once per Pauli and combine the results yourself. If the observable is not a single Pauli term, it raises a `NotImplementedError`.\n"
msgstr "Observable harus berupa **satu suku Pauli**. Untuk observable dengan beberapa suku, panggil fungsi ini sekali per Pauli dan gabungkan hasilnya sendiri. Jika observable bukan satu suku Pauli, fungsi ini memunculkan `NotImplementedError`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the standard workflow, it belongs between computing the forward bounds and merging them with the\n"
"backward bounds, as the [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart) shows.\n"
msgstr "Dalam alur kerja standar, langkah ini ditempatkan antara menghitung bound maju dan menggabungkannya dengan bound mundur, seperti yang ditunjukkan [panduan quickstart](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart).\n"
